reviews.text:
Visible is so much better than my Fitbit for tracking my heart rate (with POTS) and helping me stay on top of pacing and and taking time to rest so I don’t crash (ME/CFS). It also helps me visualize trends and changes in symptoms. 
I appreciate that the armband has a decent battery life so I only have to remember to charge it every few days and that it’s waterproof so I can capture my new “cardio” activities, like showering. {insert exhausted eyeroll}
I took a chance and subscribed a few months ago and, seriously, no regrets.
